# Structures that engine/disc.situ must refuse, every one of them: each
# one of the accepted vectors with one byte changed, the comment saying
# which rule it breaks.

# orders_differ: a file's record whose extent says one sector little-endian and another big: a reader on the other byte order would read the wrong one
